        title       Durability: release versions, key fingerprints and record migration (slice 2b)
        status      draft
        priority    high
        blocked_by  [@task.V3.T20, @T57]
        satisfies   [@plan.Persistence.O5, @plan.Runtime.O3]
        description
            Build release versions on production: key fingerprints, identity versions, saved-shape resets with record
            migration, and `previous` holds.

