    T23
        title       `nub run verify` builds and checks v3
        status      draft
        priority    medium
        blocked_by  [@T22]
        satisfies   [@plan.FlowState.O1]
        description
            Point `nub run build` and the docs build at `packages/flow-state-v3`, and pass `nub run verify`.
            `packages/flow-state-v3/package.json` gains the six routes' `exports` map (@plan.Package.O1) and the `flow`
            bin, plus a packed-consumer smoke check that later stage gates run.

            **Why now:** `verify` does not build the frozen package; only `build`, `scripts/check-toolchain.mjs` and
            `apps/docs/scripts/generate-api-reference.mjs` read the frozen packages, so they cannot be removed and the
            gate does not yet prove v3. The package's routes and bin are also built here, early, so later Tasks export
            through them.

            **Read first:** code:package.json, code:scripts/check-toolchain.mjs, @plan.Package.O1.

            May change: `package.json`, `packages/flow-state-v3/package.json`, `scripts/`, `apps/docs/scripts/`,
            `knip.json`, `tsconfig.json`. Evidence: this Task's comments.

            False pass: a verify that passes because a step was dropped → caught by listing each step of today's
            `verify` with what replaces it. Stops: removing `packages/flow-state` and `packages/flow-state-rewrite`,
            which @plan.FlowState keeps frozen until a product cutover.
        acceptance
            - `nub run verify` passes, and its build, toolchain check and docs steps read `packages/flow-state-v3`.
            - Nothing in `verify` reads the frozen packages.
            - `packages/flow-state-v3/package.json` has the six routes' `exports` map and the `flow` bin, and the
              packed-consumer smoke check passes on a packed tarball.
        comment     2026-11-16T02:04:36Z
            Routed from P2's completion audit: nub run verify no longer runs any stress file; the full gate should
            include nub run test:stress.

    T73
        title       UI primitives, third wave: combobox, tree and token input fixtures
        status      draft
        priority    medium
        blocked_by  [@T21, @T57]
        description
            Build the async combobox, the lazy tree and the token input as fixtures, each with ui-sdk's behaviour
            scenarios ported as Story tests.

            **Why now:** the third wave of the ui-sdk fixtures the user chose (the user, 2026-11-16). They need reads
            and `subscribe.each` (@task.V3.T21) and the full schedule forms (@task.V3.T57): debounced latest-wins search
            with paging, per-branch cancellable loads, and undo history with late-settling items.

            **Read first:** code:wiki/plans/flow/references/proposals/ui-primitives-generality-2026-11-16.md (the three
            machines), code:wiki/plans/flow/references/proposals/ui-primitives-2026-11-16.md, the upstream core tests in
            `codebases/ui-sdk/packages/core/test/`: `combobox*.test.ts` (24), `tree*.test.ts` (69) and
            `token-input*.test.ts` (29), at commit `98ba9fd`.

            **Risk:** the generality pass found that props in `Flow.input` reset the actor; send props by event (or use
            declared props if the user accepts them first). The proposal names three probable upstream bugs (a collapse
            while loading, a stale `hasMore`, a refused undo); pin the correct behaviour, not upstream's.

            **Approach:** as @task.V3.T71: four-file folders, usual and stress Stories, a mapping comment, drops
            with reasons.

            May change: `fixtures/combobox/`, `fixtures/tree/`, `fixtures/token-input/`, `tests/`. Evidence: this
            Task's comments.

            False pass: a ported test that asserts less than its upstream case → caught by the mapping comment and `nub
            run faults`.

            User's read: each dropped upstream scenario with its reason.
        acceptance
            - `fixtures/combobox/`, `fixtures/tree/` and `fixtures/token-input/` exist in the four-file shape, each with
              a usual and a stress Story.
            - Every core test of ui-sdk's combobox (24), tree (69) and token input (29) maps to a Story test asserting
              the same behaviour, or is listed as dropped with its reason, in one mapping comment on this Task.
            - The three probable upstream bugs the proposal names are pinned as the correct behaviour.
            - The run rules and the reload sweep cover the new Stories; each new runtime rule has a planted fault that
              `nub run faults` catches, and a dead core fails every new test.
            - The package never imports, reads or names `codebases/`; `nub run check` and `nub run lint:rules` pass.
